---
config: {
    "theme": "base",
    "look": "classic",
    "layout": "dagre",
    "themeVariables": {
        "primaryColor": "#4a90d9",
        "primaryTextColor": "#ffffff",
        "primaryBorderColor": "#2c6fb6",
        "secondaryColor": "#f5a623",
        "secondaryTextColor": "#ffffff",
        "secondaryBorderColor": "#d4891a",
        "tertiaryColor": "#7ed321",
        "tertiaryTextColor": "#ffffff",
        "tertiaryBorderColor": "#5ea81a",
        "lineColor": "#00bcd4",
        "errorColor": "#e74c3c",
        "errorTextColor": "#ffffff",
        "errorBorderColor": "#c0392b"
    }
}
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Orchestrator
    participant MemoryMgr
    participant SystemThinker
    participant Explorer
    participant MemoryAgent
    participant Implementer
    participant Reviewer

    %% === ORIENT ===
    User->>Orchestrator: Request / Chat Input
    Note over Orchestrator: PHASE 0: ORIENT
    Orchestrator->>+MemoryMgr: Query project state
    MemoryMgr-->>-Orchestrator: Current phase + goal hierarchy
    Orchestrator->>+MemoryMgr: Light RAG: recent decisions, key facts
    MemoryMgr-->>-Orchestrator: Summarized context
    Note over Orchestrator: Position established

    %% === CLARIFY ===
    Note over Orchestrator: PHASE 1: CLARIFY
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Assess specificity

    alt Vague request
        Orchestrator-->>User: Probe: goal? constraints? scope?
        User-->>Orchestrator: Refined input
    end

    Orchestrator->>+MemoryMgr: Check goal alignment
    MemoryMgr-->>-Orchestrator: Match / no match

    alt New goal
        Orchestrator->>MemoryMgr: Register new goal in hierarchy
    end

    %% === ASSESS ===
    Note over Orchestrator: PHASE 2: ASSESS
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Evaluate complexity

    alt Complex / multi-domain
        Orchestrator->>+SystemThinker: Spawn with domain skills
        SystemThinker-->>-Orchestrator: Summary + recommendation
    else Moderate / needs context
        Note over Orchestrator: Proceed to context gathering
    else Trivial
        Note over Orchestrator: Execute directly
    end

    %% === GATHER ===
    Note over Orchestrator: PHASE 3: GATHER CONTEXT

    par Light retrieval (early)
        Orchestrator->>+MemoryMgr: Project notes, decisions, bugs
        MemoryMgr-->>-Orchestrator: Relevant context
    and File / code structure
        Orchestrator->>+Explorer: Search filesystem, deps
        Explorer-->>-Orchestrator: Structural map
    and Deep semantic search
        Orchestrator->>+MemoryAgent: GraphRAG + Qdrant query
        MemoryAgent-->>-Orchestrator: Semantic results
    end

    Note over Orchestrator: Progressive deepening guard

    alt Too deep too early
        Orchestrator-->>User: Present findings, ask direction
        User-->>Orchestrator: Narrow / broaden / redirect
    end

    %% === SYNTHESIZE ===
    Note over Orchestrator: PHASE 4: SYNTHESIZE
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Reduce + summarize context

    %% === GATE 1: APPROACH ===
    Note over Orchestrator,User: GATE 1: APPROACH
    Orchestrator-->>User: 2-3 options + trade-offs

    alt User rejects approach
        User-->>Orchestrator: Re-scope or refine
        Note over Orchestrator: Return to ORIENT
    else User approves
        User-->>Orchestrator: Approved
        Orchestrator->>MemoryMgr: Log decision
    end

    %% === GATE 2: SPEC ===
    Note over Orchestrator,User: GATE 2: SPEC
    Orchestrator->>+SystemThinker: Write pseudocode spec
    SystemThinker-->>-Orchestrator: Spec written

    Orchestrator-->>User: Spec for approval

    alt User rejects spec
        User-->>Orchestrator: Re-design
        Note over Orchestrator: Return to ORIENT
    else User approves
        User-->>Orchestrator: Approved
        Orchestrator->>MemoryMgr: Log approved spec
    end

    %% === GATE 3: CODE ===
    Note over Orchestrator,User: GATE 3: CODE
    Orchestrator->>+Implementer: Translate spec to code
    Implementer-->>-Orchestrator: Code + test results

    Orchestrator-->>User: Implementation for approval

    alt User rejects code
        User-->>Orchestrator: Fix / re-implement
        Orchestrator->>+Implementer: Revise
        Implementer-->>-Orchestrator: Revised code
    else User approves
        User-->>Orchestrator: Approved
        Orchestrator->>MemoryMgr: Log implementation
    end

    %% === GATE 4: REVIEW ===
    Note over Orchestrator,User: GATE 4: REVIEW
    Orchestrator->>+Reviewer: Verify code against spec
    Reviewer-->>-Orchestrator: Review: pass / fail / changes

    Orchestrator-->>User: Review results + verdict

    alt User rejects review
        User-->>Orchestrator: Rework needed
        Note over Orchestrator: Return to GATE 3
    else User signs off
        User-->>Orchestrator: Signed off
        Orchestrator->>MemoryMgr: Log review, update phase
    end

    %% === DELIVER ===
    Note over Orchestrator,User: DELIVER
    Orchestrator-->>User: Final result

    alt Session continues
        User-->>Orchestrator: New task / refine / new session
        Note over Orchestrator: Loop to ORIENT
    else Session ends
        Orchestrator->>MemoryMgr: Persist handoff, ratings
        Orchestrator-->>User: Session complete
    end
